{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"Water in plants: how it moves","theme":{"background":"#f4fbf2","foreground":"#1d3b1a","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Xylem"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"Tubes inside a plant's roots and stem that carry water and minerals up from the roots to the leaves."},{"type":"image","id":"c1-p","picto":"tree"},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Transpiration"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"The loss of water vapour from the leaves through tiny holes called stomata. It helps pull more water up the plant."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which part of a plant takes in most of its water?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"The leaves","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"The roots","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"The flowers","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"What is the name of the tubes that carry water up a plant?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Phloem","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Xylem","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Stomata","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-d","label":"Chloroplasts","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"It is a hot, sunny day. Your plant is wilting. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Water the plant at its roots","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Spray only the leaves","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You pour water on the soil. The roots soak it up and the stem stands tall again. Well done!"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"The leaves look wet, but the soil is still dry. The roots cannot get the water they need."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"Where does most water leave a plant?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Through the stomata in the leaves","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Through the roots","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"Through the petals","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"Well done! You finished the water in plants quiz."},{"type":"text","id":"c9-m","content":"You now know how water travels from the roots to the leaves. Keep asking questions about the plants around you."}],"actions":[]}}
